  "body": "Same as https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2385 but for `object`. e.g. if it changes between `display: none` and `display: inline` repeatedly.\r\n\r\nIt also seems like the spec requires several tasks to be queued to \"(re)determine what the object element represents\" when a script (1) creates an element (2) sets `type` (3) sets `classid` (4) sets `data` (5) inserts to the document (so it changes to being rendered).",
